# Frontend tooling — node_modules and logs are noise.
node_modules
*.log
npm-debug.log*
*.local

# IMPORTANT: dist/ is NOT ignored here.
#
# The Rust binary embeds `assets/ide/dist/` at compile time via rust-embed.
# `cargo build` and `nix build` consume whatever is in `dist/` at that
# moment — so the built frontend tree must be committed to git, otherwise
# the released `neo` binary serves nothing.
#
# Workflow: `pnpm build` (or `npm run build`) inside this dir before
# committing — the diff in `dist/` is part of the PR.

# Playwright e2e artifacts (harness drives Brave against `vite preview`).
/test-results
/playwright-report
/blob-report
/e2e-out
